WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:02.020
John: Gooood Morning, Hank, it's Tuesday.

00:00:02.020 --> 00:00:03.020
Wait, it's Tuesday.

00:00:03.020 --> 00:00:05.420
That means that I am no longer for the United
States.

00:00:05.420 --> 00:00:07.590
I am now all in for Mexico!

00:00:07.590 --> 00:00:11.070
Hank, as you know I am auctioning off my World
Cup support for Sarcoma research - link in

00:00:11.070 --> 00:00:12.070
the doobly-doo.

00:00:12.070 --> 00:00:16.059
Every time you donate $1, I donate 3, and
in total we've now raised more than $55,000

00:00:16.059 --> 00:00:19.029
to fight Sarcoma, which is so awesome.

00:00:19.029 --> 00:00:21.960
Hey, why are you only gesticulating with one
hand?

00:00:21.960 --> 00:00:23.470
Well, funny story...

00:00:23.470 --> 00:00:26.140
So Hank, as you know I am a retired semi-professional
FIFA player.

00:00:26.140 --> 00:00:30.050
For years, I uploaded my FIFA videos to YouTube,
people watched them, advertising revenue,

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:31.050
etc.

00:00:31.050 --> 00:00:34.859
But a while ago, I decided to retire from
professional FIFA playing because I'm older

00:00:34.859 --> 00:00:39.269
now and the physical and emotional strain
had just gotten to be too much.

00:00:39.269 --> 00:00:42.960
I decided I had to play just for the love
of the game, for the love of the pixels.

00:00:42.960 --> 00:00:47.239
So all the money we make now goes to an actual
football club, AFC Wimbledon, owned by its

00:00:47.239 --> 00:00:50.500
fans, the first football club to come out
against homophobia in England; they're just

00:00:50.500 --> 00:00:51.500
amazing.

00:00:51.500 --> 00:00:54.330
Right, okay Hank, so if you're like me and
you're not actually very good at FIFA it's

00:00:54.330 --> 00:00:57.489
not enough to like press the joystick in the
right directions and hit the right buttons.

00:00:57.489 --> 00:01:02.050
You have to create a loving, supportive environment
for your team made of pixels so that they

00:01:02.050 --> 00:01:03.579
feel comfortable scoring.

00:01:03.579 --> 00:01:06.770
Now for me a big part of that is yelling at
the screen, sometimes like pulling this way

00:01:06.770 --> 00:01:10.430
when I want them to go that way, but it also
involves some singing, and then when they

00:01:10.430 --> 00:01:12.610
score, I want to celebrate with them!

00:01:12.610 --> 00:01:16.910
All of this is to say, Hank, that recently,
the AFC Wimbledon Wimbly Womblys scored a

00:01:16.910 --> 00:01:22.501
goal so beautiful, so amazing that I did what
any manager would do: I shot up my arms and

00:01:22.501 --> 00:01:28.150
I shouted, "AFC Wimbledon!"

00:01:28.150 --> 00:01:33.280
Only I did it with both arms, because that
was back when I could move both of my shoulders.

00:01:33.280 --> 00:01:38.380
That's right Hank, I shot my right arm into
the air after scoring a goal in a video game

00:01:38.380 --> 00:01:40.200
and seriously injured my shoulder.

00:01:40.200 --> 00:01:41.680
How seriously?

00:01:41.680 --> 00:01:43.600
Not yet clear, waiting for some test results.

00:01:43.600 --> 00:01:47.540
How do you injure yourself playing a video
game?!

00:01:47.540 --> 00:01:50.260
Actually, no, I did not injure myself playing
a video game.

00:01:50.260 --> 00:01:54.540
I injured myself celebrating my success playing
a video game.

00:01:54.540 --> 00:01:57.370
So yeah, Hank, this whole experience has made
me realize something: I'm old.

00:01:57.370 --> 00:02:01.860
I have a lot of gray hair over here, but in
the two months of promoting The Fault in Our

00:02:01.860 --> 00:02:04.670
Stars movie I got a lot of new gray hair up
in here.

00:02:04.670 --> 00:02:08.390
Now Hank, thankfully you're not old and, as
far as I can tell, you never will be.

00:02:08.390 --> 00:02:13.280
You have the body of a man in his 30's, but
the personality and face of an excited 9-year-old,

00:02:13.280 --> 00:02:14.520
which I mean as a compliment.

00:02:14.520 --> 00:02:18.390
So Hank, hopefully you'll be the brother who
doesn't get old and, like, stays hip and cool,

00:02:18.390 --> 00:02:20.280
but Nerdfighters, I am getting old.

00:02:20.280 --> 00:02:23.250
In fact, I'm older than I was when I started
this video.

00:02:23.250 --> 00:02:26.940
I'm having a little bit of a crisis about
being old because I wanna be a Nerdfighter

00:02:26.940 --> 00:02:29.550
for the rest of my life, so I'm hoping there
are other old Nerdfighters.

00:02:29.550 --> 00:02:30.730
I think there are.

00:02:30.730 --> 00:02:34.770
But mostly I just wanted to say I hope we
can still be friends even though I am old

00:02:34.770 --> 00:02:35.770
and shoulder-less.

00:02:35.770 --> 00:02:38.200
Again, link in the doobly-doo to our World
Cup fundraiser.

00:02:38.200 --> 00:02:41.730
You can follow along the World Cup with me
at my sports Twitter, @sportswithjohn.

00:02:41.730 --> 00:02:44.360
Hank, don't play video games too strenuously.

00:02:44.360 --> 00:02:45.569
I will see you on Friday.

